        "node_id": "n_10_99b399",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is correct in its graph-based representation and cycle detection, but it fails to print the reconstructed text. The error is in the final output step, where the function doesn't return or print the result. To fix this, we need to ensure that the reconstructed text is printed at the end of the function.",
